id=sms_clipboard_sync
name=SMS + Clipboard Sync
version=2.1.5
versionCode=215
author=Clipboard Sync contributors (merged with Msg2Bark by Kevin)
description=Event-driven SMS forwarding to cloud/WeChat + Android clipboard sync. One-click upgrade from the old Clipboard Sync and Msg2Bark modules: imports their settings and removes them automatically. No APK, no Python, no curl, no periodic SMS DB scan.
